      },
      "message": "Add lazylean, a C++ kernel with a lazy Coq-style reduction engine (#230)\n\nAdds lazylean (https://github.com/corun1024/lazylean), a Lean 4 kernel\nin C++ whose weak-head normalisation is a lazy Krivine machine in the\nstyle of Coq's cClosure. It uses Lean's type-checking algorithm,\nre-derives recursors and compares them with the exported ones, and\ndeclines reduceBool/reduceNat.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Chris Emery <chris@duleno.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
